    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίγειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surrounding the earth</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶς</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθέριος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π</span>. Cleanth.ib.<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χῶρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.196
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					2.47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of the earth</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀέριος</span>
			etc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
					8(4).252
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astron.,
				<i>near the earth</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελήνη</span>
			Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				55.23
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				9.1
			</span></i> : 
				Sup.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημεῖον</span>) <i>perigee</i>, ibid.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐναντίωσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phlp.
					<u>in Cat.</u>
					80.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
